                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23 Repatriates/4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Peru</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Dearing</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-24T11:00:00-05:00">February 24, 1933—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>40. Your 96, February 21, midnight, and 99 February 23, 10 a.m. Department
                    believes it inadvisable for you or the Department to take any initiative in this
                    matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
